          "comment": "# Comfy Image Upscale- Wan 2.2 Two-Stage\n\nUpload an image and set a resize factor. Generate an AI prompt from your image and upscale it in two controlled stages to enhance detail and fidelity. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/utility_sirolim_image_controlled_upscale.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
